    "normalization": "Pinned Unicode 17 recursive canonical decomposition, stable class ordering and font-covered recomposition; Hangul is algorithmic. Ordinary cmap-only text retains its fast path.",
    "clusters": "SourceOffset selects original paint ownership; shared ClusterStart/End survive reordering and substitutions. Only the last glyph consumes a cluster during fitting.",
    "substitution": "Selected default Latin/DFLT ccmp: unfiltered singles, ligatures and bounded class contexts calling singles. Existing liga remains distinct.",
    "positioning": "Shared bounded class-context validation; actual GPOS XAdvance execution; selected mark/mkmk base, actual ligature-component and mark anchors with validated GDEF filtering. Mark/default-ignorable advances are zeroed after positioning.",
    "paths": "Before mask-strike relaxation, either transformed font axis strictly exceeding 256 pixels selects a 64-pixel unhinted canonical outline and unsnapped placement. Existing analytic fill, shader and clip stages paint directly without a glyph bitmap.",
    "ownership": "Transient budgeted glyph/cluster and path-command owners; fonts stay borrowed. Peak-minus-one refusal, exact-peak retry and cancellation release storage.",
    "boundaries": "Physical face/size, paint, spacing, absolute positions, native scaled-element nodes and placement boundaries remain distinct. Attached marks on text paths, other language tailoring and general bidi/complex-script shaping remain unsupported."
